{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 11, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "the system\n  x = 2 mod 3: x = 2\n    x = 2 (mod 3)\n  x = 3 mod 5: x = 3\n    x = 3 (mod 5)\nx = 8 (mod 15)\n  how: the Chinese remainder theorem, pairwise (moduli that share factors must agree mod their gcd)\n  check: the solution substituted into every congruence: it holds; brute force over 0..14: 1 solution\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 11, "ok": true, "cmd": "crt", "ucas": "crt x = 2 mod 3, x = 3 mod 5", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "crt", "solutions": ["8"], "modulus": "15", "x": ["2 mod 3: x = 2", "2 (mod 3)", "3 mod 5: x = 3", "3 (mod 5)"], "method": "the Chinese remainder theorem, pairwise (moduli that share factors must agree mod their gcd)", "headline": "the system", "more": ["x = 8 (mod 15)"]}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [{"kind": "check", "passed": true, "text": "the solution substituted into every congruence: it holds; brute force over 0..14: 1 solution"}], "files": [], "text": "the system\n  x = 2 mod 3: x = 2\n    x = 2 (mod 3)\n  x = 3 mod 5: x = 3\n    x = 3 (mod 5)\nx = 8 (mod 15)\n  how: the Chinese remainder theorem, pairwise (moduli that share factors must agree mod their gcd)\n  check: the solution substituted into every congruence: it holds; brute force over 0..14: 1 solution\n"}, "isError": false}}
{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 12, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "the system\n  x = 2 mod 4: x = 2\n    x = 2 (mod 4)\n  x = 4 mod 6: x = 4\n    x = 4 (mod 6)\nx = 10 (mod 12)\n  how: the Chinese remainder theorem, pairwise (moduli that share factors must agree mod their gcd)\n  check: the solution substituted into every congruence: it holds; brute force over 0..11: 1 solution\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 12, "ok": true, "cmd": "crt", "ucas": "crt x = 2 mod 4, x = 4 mod 6", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "crt", "solutions": ["10"], "modulus": "12", "x": ["2 mod 4: x = 2", "2 (mod 4)", "4 mod 6: x = 4", "4 (mod 6)"], "method": "the Chinese remainder theorem, pairwise (moduli that share factors must agree mod their gcd)", "headline": "the system", "more": ["x = 10 (mod 12)"]}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [{"kind": "check", "passed": true, "text": "the solution substituted into every congruence: it holds; brute force over 0..11: 1 solution"}], "files": [], "text": "the system\n  x = 2 mod 4: x = 2\n    x = 2 (mod 4)\n  x = 4 mod 6: x = 4\n    x = 4 (mod 6)\nx = 10 (mod 12)\n  how: the Chinese remainder theorem, pairwise (moduli that share factors must agree mod their gcd)\n  check: the solution substituted into every congruence: it holds; brute force over 0..11: 1 solution\n"}, "isError": false}}
{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 13, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "the system\n  x = 2 mod 4: x = 2\n    x = 2 (mod 4)\n  x = 3 mod 6: x = 3\n    x = 3 (mod 6)\nno solution: the congruences contradict each other (CRT: the residues differ mod the gcd of the moduli)\n  check: brute force over 0..11: 0 solutions\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 13, "ok": true, "cmd": "crt", "ucas": "crt x = 2 mod 4, x = 3 mod 6", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "crt", "solutions": [], "x": ["2 mod 4: x = 2", "2 (mod 4)", "3 mod 6: x = 3", "3 (mod 6)"], "headline": "the system", "more": ["no solution: the congruences contradict each other (CRT: the residues differ mod the gcd of the moduli)"]}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [{"kind": "check", "passed": true, "text": "brute force over 0..11: 0 solutions"}], "files": [], "text": "the system\n  x = 2 mod 4: x = 2\n    x = 2 (mod 4)\n  x = 3 mod 6: x = 3\n    x = 3 (mod 6)\nno solution: the congruences contradict each other (CRT: the residues differ mod the gcd of the moduli)\n  check: brute force over 0..11: 0 solutions\n"}, "isError": false}}
{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 14, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "the system\n  x = 1 mod 1: every x (the equation is 0 = 0 mod 1)\n    x = 0 (mod 1)\n  x = 2 mod 3: x = 2\n    x = 2 (mod 3)\nx = 2 (mod 3)\n  how: the Chinese remainder theorem, pairwise (moduli that share factors must agree mod their gcd)\n  check: the solution substituted into every congruence: it holds; brute force over 0..2: 1 solution\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 14, "ok": true, "cmd": "crt", "ucas": "crt x = 1 mod 1, x = 2 mod 3", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "crt", "solutions": ["2"], "modulus": "3", "x": ["1 mod 1: every x (the equation is 0 = 0 mod 1)", "0 (mod 1)", "2 mod 3: x = 2", "2 (mod 3)"], "method": "the Chinese remainder theorem, pairwise (moduli that share factors must agree mod their gcd)", "headline": "the system", "more": ["x = 2 (mod 3)"]}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [{"kind": "check", "passed": true, "text": "the solution substituted into every congruence: it holds; brute force over 0..2: 1 solution"}], "files": [], "text": "the system\n  x = 1 mod 1: every x (the equation is 0 = 0 mod 1)\n    x = 0 (mod 1)\n  x = 2 mod 3: x = 2\n    x = 2 (mod 3)\nx = 2 (mod 3)\n  how: the Chinese remainder theorem, pairwise (moduli that share factors must agree mod their gcd)\n  check: the solution substituted into every congruence: it holds; brute force over 0..2: 1 solution\n"}, "isError": false}}
